{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19880","headline":"冬日 · 孟郊","name":"冬日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老人行人事，百一不及周。\n冻马四蹄吃，陟卓难自收。\n短景仄飞过，午光不上头。\n少壮日与辉，衰老日与愁。\n日愁疑在日，岁箭迸如讐。\n万事有何味，一生虚自囚。\n不知文字利，到死空遨游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}